{"pageid":3248,"title":"Ownership Manager","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Ownership Manager</span>","revid":15381,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote><p><i>\"Allows you to clear &amp; transfer ownership of items! Providing a power input of 10.0 will clear the ownership of items, and providing a user id will transfer the ownership to that player.\"</i></p><blockquote>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Ownership Manager</h2>\n\n\t<div class=\"pi-image-collection wds-tabber\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<li role=\"tab\" id=\"pi-tab-6a97265facc0a-0\" class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" aria-controls=\"pi-tabpanel-6a97265facc0a-0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUnboxed\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<li role=\"tab\" id=\"pi-tab-6a97265facc0a-1\" class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" aria-controls=\"pi-tabpanel-6a97265facc0a-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBoxed\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"pi-tabpanel-6a97265facc0a-0\" aria-labelledby=\"pi-tab-6a97265facc0a-0\">\n\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Missing_Image.png/revision/latest?cb=20250220182005\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Unboxed\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Missing_Image.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250220182005\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Missing_Image.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250220182005 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Missing_Image.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20250220182005 2x\" data-relevant=\"1\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Unboxed\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Missing Image.png\" data-image-name=\"Missing Image.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"pi-tabpanel-6a97265facc0a-1\" aria-labelledby=\"pi-tab-6a97265facc0a-1\">\n\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Missing_Image.png/revision/latest?cb=20250220182005\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Boxed\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Missing_Image.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250220182005\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Missing_Image.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250220182005 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Missing_Image.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20250220182005 2x\" data-relevant=\"1\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Boxed\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Missing Image.png\" data-image-name=\"Missing Image.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Store\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Store</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Details</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Purpose\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Purpose</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Transfers or removes ownership of items based on power input. Will only work with your own items.</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">idk man (1.65.0)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\nThe <b>Ownership Manager</b> is a logic component that can be purchased from <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a>. It changes ownership of items.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Functionality\">Functionality</span></h2>\n<p>The Ownership Manager can remove ownership or transfer ownership of items freely, but only one at a time. The probe in front of it is purely decorational, as well as the case with the <a href=\"/wiki/Interactor\" title=\"Interactor\">Interactor</a>, as you now select a range/area of an item that will have its ownership changed. However, to change or remove ownership of items in a range, any and all items within the range must be owned by you, either causing, or having the problem of it only being able to change the ownership of one item at a time(May change in a later update, not fixed as of 1.66.2). To remove ownership, the Ownership Manager requires a signal of 10.0.\n</p><p>However, to change ownership of an item to another player, the required signal must be the player ID of the player you wish to transfer item ownership to, making it very ineffective to change ownership to other players in this way, as it would require a number interface(orthodoxically).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<p>As Roblox IDs are 64 bit integers, this means that any accounts with a user ID that are, or greater than 10*10^14 or, 15 or more digits long, they will not be able to have ownership transferred to them, at least not very easily through the same number interface method, as number interfaces can only output 14 digits of signal, or, up to 999,999,999,999,999.\n</p></blockquote></blockquote>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901192415\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.031 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 84/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 126/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   23.728      1 Template:Logic\n100.00%   23.728      1 -total\n  5.81%    1.378      1 Template:Mainonly\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3248-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901192415 and revision id 15381. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Logic"],"links":[{"title":"Alan's AutoLogistics","exists":true},{"title":"Finlay Island","exists":true},{"title":"Interactor","exists":true}],"images":["Missing_Image.png"]}
